{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700410/extras/6ffcb73befb21f12ee6b033baa1f51b5.avif?t=1752585970\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700410/extras_big/6ffcb73befb21f12ee6b033baa1f51b5.avif?t=1752585970 width=800 height=398 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scope</strong> is a high-stakes, 100-player battle royale where survival means everything and freedom is the ultimate prize. Set on a remote island deep in the ocean, players take on the roles of memory-wiped warriors trapped in high-tech robotic suits. Each has been kidnapped, trained, and forced to fight in a ruthless tournament where only one can rise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dropped from a transport plane into a sprawling, ever-shrinking battlefield, players must explore dense mountain forests to open grassy plains\u2014scavenging for weapons, supplies, and the upper hand. With no special abilities to rely on, only strategy, reflexes, and raw skill will separate the victor from the fallen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized visuals, intense solo or squad action, and a mysterious backstory lurking beneath the surface make <strong>Scope</strong> more than just a fight\u2014it's a test of who you are when everything else has been stripped away.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome To Scope","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3700410/3df8b6b3b510ded0811fd6947091306aede4791e.jpg"},{"name":"VICTORY! ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3700410/38721b2389ea22387de90df0865abf72ad155c8f.jpg"}],"total":2},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3700410?t=1752585970","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700410/95c29e7d753d9cf1c85