ial abilities to rely on, only strategy, reflexes, and raw skill will separate the victor from the fallen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized visuals, intense solo or squad action, and a mysterious backstory lurking beneath the surface make <strong>Scope</strong> more than just a fight\u2014it's a test of who you are when everything else has been stripped away.</p>","developers":["Operation games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700410/eb5dc519f02aa65070ab126b220d7d1c029b1e77/header.jpg?t=1752585970","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Operation Games. All rights reserved. All trademarks are the property of their respective owners.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3700410/1015672331/1f9f5dcbb50d21db34bbdb2fb013ccb984dfcc93/1750836159/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752334543","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3700410/1015672331/1f9f5dcbb50d21db34bbdb2fb013ccb984dfcc93/1750836159/dash_h264.mpd?t=1752334543","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3700410/1015672331/1f9f5dcbb50d21db34bbdb2fb013ccb984dfcc93/1750836159/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1752334543","id":257156197,"name":"Scope Battle Royale - Early Access Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257156197/72fea93614162e83f7efa2ee975697137111c28e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752334543"},{"dash_av